# [2026-10-13] Stashed build sourcemaps. These ARE the source, de-minified, and
# one build is ~7 MB. They live on the box so scripts/whereis.js can translate a
# crash location; they must never enter git, which is the same reasoning as M18.
sourcemaps/

# [BACKUP-ZEUS 2026-10-19] Operator backups: encrypted full dumps of the whole
# database (exchange keys, password hashes, every user). They must never be
# committed, and a `git add -A` would have taken them straight to GitHub.
data/admin_backups/
# Rotated audit logs — data/audit.jsonl was ignored but its rotations were not,
# so 20+ of them are already in history. See the Book: removing them needs a
# history rewrite, which is the operator decision.
data/audit.jsonl.*
